<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-guandu">Battle of Guandu</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Guandu was fought in 200 CE near the Yellow River in northern China between the warlords Cao Cao and Yuan Shao.</p></div></li></ol></section>
