<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-guandu"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Guandu.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Guandu</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Liu Bei rebels and seizes Xu Province, and Cao Cao turns east and retakes it</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-guandu"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Guandu.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Guandu</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Yuan Shao marches to Liyang, and Yan Liang and Wen Chou are killed in the first skirmishes</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-guandu"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Guandu.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Guandu</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Yuan Shao advances from Yangwu in the eighth month and the armies settle into trench warfare at Guandu</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-guandu"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Guandu.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Guandu</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">In the ninth month Cao Cao's cavalry burns Yuan Shao's grain carts at Gushi</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-guandu"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Guandu.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Guandu</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">In the tenth month Cao Cao raids Wuchao by night, Zhang He and Gao Lan surrender, and Yuan Shao's army collapses</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/maya-religion"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Maya%20religion.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Maya religion</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Classic period (200 to 900 CE) begins, with kingdoms whose rituals of kingship are central to court life</span></li></ul></section>
